# Grinding a moving car: a car does 7 m/s up Valencia; the skater comes down onto its roof's left
# edge going 3 m/s faster, grind pressed: a 50-50 on the car roof (the line moves with the car, the
# grind speed is relative to it), off the front end after 0.7 s, landing on the road at 9.5 m/s.
park sf
spawn valencia_shops
cmd 0 traffic clear
cmd 0 teleport -62.3 -322 2.31 0
cmd 1 car -51.1 -331.2 356 7
cmd 60 teleport -50.35 -328.89 4.04 355.2
cmd 60 set skater.vel.x -0.83
cmd 60 set skater.vel.y 9.96
tap grind 70
run 300
expect event grindStart{trick=FS 50-50,line=car roof} within 70..74
expect event grindEnd{reason=end} within 150..165
expect event land{quality=clean} within 240..255
expect skater.speed > 9 at 255
expect event comboLanded{name=FS 50-50} within 250..270
expect no event bail
